  "description": "Now available to rent, this bright and well-presented one-bedroom apartment is ideally located in the popular development of lansdowne Gate within the residential area of Drimnagh, Dublin 12 just a short walk from Crumlin Children's Hospital. Offering a comfortable and modern living space, this property is perfect for those looking to be close to the City Centre. The apartment features a spacious open-plan living and dining area with large windows that provide excellent natural light. The modern kitchen comes fully equipped with integrated appliances and ample storage. Generously sized bedroom, with built-in wardrobes, while the main bathroom is finished to a high standard with contemporary fittings. Additional benefits include double-glazed windows, efficient heating, and secure access. Located within walking distance of local shops, cafés, schools, and parks, the property is well-served by public transport, including the nearby Luas Red Line, making the city centre and surrounding areas easily accessible. The development is also close to the M50 motorway, junctions 10 and 11. Crumlin College, Greenhills Community College, & Walkinstown Library are all located nearby. Attractions such as Drimnagh Castle, William Pearse Park, The Phoenix Park, and Stillgarden Distillary are nearby. Multiple supermarkets and The Ashleaf Shopping Centre are within walking distance. Sustainability features Public transport: Dublin Bus routes including 13, 18, 68. 69, 56A, 151, S4. The Luas Red Line runs from Tallaght to Dublin City Centre, with numerous stops such as Drimnagh, Bluebell, and Blackhorse. District Heating System. On-site recycling facilities with multiple waste streams. Resident engagement programme. Biodiversity initiatives. Key Features: spacious bedrooms with built-in wardrobes Modern kitchen with appliances Bright open-plan living/dining area Stylish main bathroom Minutes from Crumlin Children's Hospital Excellent location with Luas access nearby Close to amenities and green spaces Available immediately. Early viewing is highly As an I-RES resident, you can be assured of: - Reliable professional service, when you need it - Fully trained staff to support you at every stage - Own inhouse maintenance team - 24-hour on-call support for emergencies such as loss of heat, water or essential services - Clear communications and point of contact via our resident portal We aim to reply to all emails as soon as possible, however as we receive a large number of enquiries, we may not be able to reply individually to all messages. If you do not hear from us within 48 hours, we regret that we are unable to assist you at this time. Prospect Privacy Notice: Personal data you submit in the contact form is processed by I-RES according to applicable laws and our privacy statement https://www.iresreit.ie/IRES-REIT-Privacy\n\n***PHOTOS MAY VARY BETWEEN UNITS, THE PHOTOS MAY NOT MATCH THE EXACT APARTMENT. PHOTOS FOR ILLUSTRATION PURPOSES ONLY***",
